# Egress allowlist: one domain suffix per line. dnsmasq matches every subdomain,
# so `github.com` covers codeload and the raw hosts too. Blank lines and `#`
# comments are ignored.
#
# Copied into the image at /etc/dev-firewall/allowlist and enforced on every
# container start. To add a domain without a restart, on the host:
#
#   devc firewall allow <domain>
#
# which appends here, pushes the file into the running container and re-arms.
# Commit the change. Deliberately no telemetry endpoints: those surface in the
# denial log first (`devc firewall status`), and most of them never earn a line.

